WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:03.831
Unit sixteen. Charging My Device!

2
00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:09.266
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:12.363
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.413 --> 00:00:16.318
Today we learn about Charging My Device. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.025 --> 00:00:21.716
Charge. Say it with me. Charge!

6
00:00:25.266 --> 00:00:29.190
Battery. Say it with me. Battery!

7
00:00:32.628 --> 00:00:36.595
Plug in. Say it with me. Plug in!

8
00:00:40.134 --> 00:00:43.732
Cable. Say it with me. Cable!

9
00:00:47.203 --> 00:00:51.069
Power. Say it with me. Power!

10
00:00:54.572 --> 00:00:57.972
Full. Say it with me. Full!

11
00:01:01.526 --> 00:01:05.459
Low. Say it with me. Low!

12
00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:12.771
Outlet. Say it with me. Outlet!

13
00:01:16.292 --> 00:01:25.413
I charge my device by plugging in a cable to an outlet. This gives the battery power. A full battery lasts longer than a low one.

14
00:01:25.463 --> 00:01:28.763
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:29.529 --> 00:01:34.945
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.995 --> 00:01:36.145
Plug in!

17
00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:42.834
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.884 --> 00:01:44.034
Low!

19
00:01:44.866 --> 00:01:53.213
Did you know? Most phone and tablet batteries can be charged hundreds of times before they slowly start to hold less power!

20
00:01:53.263 --> 00:01:55.569
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:05.445
Think and answer. What happens if your device's battery gets too low?

22
00:02:05.495 --> 00:02:06.645
Great answer!

23
00:02:07.575 --> 00:02:13.445
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:13.495 --> 00:02:16.603
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

